he  genre's most infamous villain in joker  in the late 1990s pretty much every  actor who could convincingly play  spider-man was considered for the part  sometimes convincingly wasn't even a  consideration and some unusual choices  outright lobbied for the role from  charlie sheen to michael jackson  obviously not all of these people were  seriously considered in the 2000s  however toby mcguire put on the mask for  three movies before being replaced by  andrew garfield in the amazing  spider-man films cut to 2015 and  spider-man was being recast this time  for the mcu again everybody under the  age of 22 was under consideration and  among the final choices were asa  butterfield and tom holland spoiler  alert holland got it even so butterfield  isn't disappointed later telling  collider every so often there's a part  that you really want and you don't get  it and it is tough and it is  but i often find that something even  better comes out of it at the end and so  in the case of spider-man i did sex  education  it's hard to picture anyone but samuel l  jackson as nick fury but apparently  jackson wasn't the first actor  approached in fact that honor goes to  george clooney honestly you can actually  kind of see this working especially if  they were going for the great temple  skirt-chasing 1960s styles super spy  version of the character and clooney  even considered taking the role at least  enough to pick up a copy of fury the  2001 comic written by garth ennis that  however turned out to be a big mistake  clooney was reportedly horrified by the  absurdly violent series apparently the  scene that particularly killed clooney's  interest in the mcu involved fury  strangling a man with his own intestines  meanwhile mark miller and brian hitches  the ultimates had already reimagined  nick fury as a certain iconic hollywood  star and so in a case of life imitating  art samuel l jackson was given the part  robert downey jr and gwyneth paltrow go  together like salt and  well  pepper  however the academy award-winning  paltrow was not iron man director john  fabro's first choice for the part of  pepper potts in fact the director was so  high on his main choice that the iron  man script was sent exclusively to  favreau's favorite rachel mcadams back  in the mid-2000s mcadams was still  basking in the warm afterglow of mean  girls and the notebook and consequently  had her pick of parts evidently iron  man's love interest wasn't high on her  list of priorities though apparently the  time traveler's wife was  i wouldn't change anything  while mcadams wasn't to play a part in  marvel's inception she later took the  role of steven strange's love interest  dr christine palmer in doctor strange  and is due to return in doctor strange  and the multiverse of madness perhaps  master of mystic arts is more her type  than billionaire military arms  industrialist  among the most prized of all female  superhero roles are characters such as  wonder woman catwoman and storm but  after the multi-billion dollar success  of the marvel cinematic universe  lesser-known characters suddenly came  into play as potential blockbuster  heroines one of these was carol danvers  otherwise known as captain marvel 25  years ago danvers was most famous to  comic book fans as the superhero who  x-men character rogue put into a coma  when she stole her powers now her  popularity rivals that of wonder woman  that's quite the turn around before  oscar winner brie larson snagged the  part however a few other big names  wanted to play captain marvel at a press  junket for jurassic world bryce dallas  howard revealed that she wanted to play  a part in a marvel movie when  interviewer eric eisenberg suggested  captain marvel howard responded yes  let's start a campaign now that would be  rad another actress who shared her  enthusiasm was olivia wilde when  meadowland director reed murano tweeted  to the film's star olivia wilde that  they should work on captain marvel  together while tweeted back oh hell yeah  let's do this well we can't say either  howard or wild we're almost captain  marvel we can be reasonably sure that  they would have jumped at the  opportunity check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite movies are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  you
 

